<title>HONG KONG: Thunderstorm warning issued in HK.</title>
<headline>Thunderstorm warning issued in HK.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A thunderstorm warning was in effect in Hong Kong on Monday, only hours ahead of elaborate ceremonies in which Hong Kong is handed back to China.</p>
<p>A Royal Hong Kong Observatory forecast warned of rain-filled weather for the early part of Monday.</p>
<p>Hong Kong reverts to Chinese rule at midnight (1600 GMT) on June 30 after a series of pageants and ceremonies, some of which will be held outdoors.</p>
</text>
